      "source_revision": "3f279169c3843b77bf5932f79bb601f7bff74120",
      "summary": "This area is the backend for a local class-recording notes tool. A person on the same machine creates a meeting, uploads audio (or streams live audio in pieces), and the system transcribes it and turns the transcript into structured study notes. Before any work starts, the system checks the file, limits how much can be uploaded, applies per-hour caps, and saves a job and audio record so processing can happen later. Only local requests from a fixed owner are allowed, and there is no real account login.",
      "api_calls_last_update": 6
    },
