      "summary": "This area is the local launcher and build/run tooling for a class-recording notes app. Shell scripts on a Mac start the database in Docker, choose a local speech-to-text service, then bring up the backend API, a background worker, and the web page, opening it in the browser. Stop scripts and CI checks keep things repeatable; the whole stack stays on the local machine.",
