      "summary": "This area stores and protects the data behind a meeting-notes service: meetings, their uploaded recordings, transcription jobs, transcript text, and generated summaries. It also sets up database structure, private file storage, error replies, and structured logs. Most pieces are foundations (schema, settings, storage); the actual web endpoints and background workers are not shown here.",
