      "summary": "This area is the background processing engine for a meeting-notes app. A separate worker process quietly picks up queued jobs, converts uploaded audio into text, and turns that text into structured class notes with topics, decisions, and action items. It also periodically deletes expired audio and abandoned drafts. Some provider wiring and the surrounding web endpoints are only partly shown.",
      "api_calls_last_update": 6
